      8  2000 ????						; THIS IS A PRELIMINARY RELEASE OF *THE* "STANDARD" VES.H
      9  2000 ????						; THIS FILE IS EXPLICITLY SUPPORTED AS A DASM-PREFERRED COMPANION FILE
     10  2000 ????						; PLEASE DO *NOT* REDISTRIBUTE THIS FILE!
     11  2000 ????						;
     12  2000 ????						; This file defines hardware registers and memory mapping for the
     13  2000 ????						; Fairchild Channel-F. It is distributed as a companion machine-specific support package
     14  2000 ????						; for the DASM compiler. Updates to this file, DASM, and associated tools are
     15  2000 ????						; available at at http://www.atari2600.org/dasm
     16  2000 ????						;
     17  2000 ????						; Many thanks to the original author(s) of this file, and to everyone who has
     18  2000 ????						; contributed to understanding the Channel-F.	If you take issue with the
     19  2000 ????						; contents, or naming of registers, please write to me (atari2600@taswegian.com)
     20  2000 ????						; with your views.  Please contribute, if you think you can improve this
